// This directory will contain Solidity verifier contracts auto-generated by snarkjs.
// After completing the trusted setup for each circuit, run:
//
//   snarkjs zkey export solidityverifier <circuit>.zkey <CircuitName>Verifier.sol
//
// Place the generated .sol files here, e.g.:
//   verifiers/OwnershipVerifier.sol
//   verifiers/MortgageVerifier.sol
//   verifiers/TransferVerifier.sol
//
// These verifiers are then imported into RootRegistry.sol (or called externally).
